#. Theme Name of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Hariko"
msgstr "Hariko"

#. Theme URI of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "https://hariko.bytedesign.net/"
msgstr "https://hariko.bytedesign.net/"

#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Hariko is a minimalist WordPress block theme designed for flexibility and customization. It includes preset colors, typography, content and wide layout sizes, reusable template parts, and standard, full-width, and sidebar templates for pages and posts. All theme text is translatable through the `hariko` text domain, and translations into Japanese, Simplified and Traditional Chinese, Korean, Spanish, French, German and Italian are bundled in the download."
msgstr "Hariko 是一款专为灵活性和定制化设计的极简 WordPress 区块主题。它内置颜色预设、排版样式、内容宽度和宽布局尺寸、可复用的模板部件，以及用于页面和文章的标准、全宽和侧边栏模板。所有主题文本均可通过 `hariko` 文本域进行翻译，下载包中附带了日语、简体中文、繁体中文、韩语、西班牙语、法语、德语和意大利语翻译。"

